      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
          <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
            <div class="feature-icon mb-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-file-richtext text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M7 4.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.5 0 .75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0m-.861 1.542 1.33.886 1.854-1.855a.25.25 0 0 1 .289-.047l1.888.974V7.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5H5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V7s1.54-1.274 1.639-1.208M5 9a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h6a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1zm0 2a.5.5 0 0 0 0 1h3a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1z"/>
                  <path d="M2 2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zm10-1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v12a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h8a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="card-title mb-3">Smart Summarization</h4>
            <p class="card-text">
              AI-powered analysis extracts key findings, methodology, and conclusions from your research paper with precision and accuracy.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
          <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
            <div class="feature-icon mb-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-easel text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M8 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .473.337L9.046 2H14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.85l1.323 3.837a.5.5 0 1 1-.946.326L11.092 11H8.5v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3H4.908l-1.435 4.163a.5.5 0 1 1-.946-.326L3.85 11H2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4.954L7.527.337A.5.5 0 0 1 8 0M2 3v7h12V3z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="card-title mb-3">Auto Slide Generation</h4>
            <p class="card-text">
              Automatically creates professional presentation slides with proper formatting, visual hierarchy, and academic standards.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
        <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
          <div class="card-body text-center p-4">
            <div class="feature-icon mb-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-lightning-charge text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M11.251.068a.5.5 0 0 1 .227.58L9.677 6.5H13a.5.5 0 0 1 .364.843l-8 8.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.842-.49L6.323 9.5H3a.5.5 0 0 1-.364-.843l8-8.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .615-.09zM4.157 8.5H7a.5.5 0 0 1 .478.647L6.11 13.59l5.732-6.09H9a.5.5 0 0 1-.478-.647L9.89 2.41z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="card-title mb-3">Lightning Fast</h4>
            <p class="card-text">
              Process papers and generate presentations in minutes, not hours. Perfect for conferences, meetings, and tight deadlines.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>